{"uid":"70061f357504e582","name":"The refresh token was spent outside the browser USER_MANAGER = ORIGINAL","fullName":"application.Samples.Feature.signInAgain.TokenRenewalAcrossTabsTest.refreshTokenSpentElsewhere","historyId":"c086b7722b11e2ba72593d7105c22150","time":{"start":1792443211720,"stop":1792443225567,"duration":13847},"description":"The test takes the refresh token the application keeps in the browser and spends it once itself, without touching the application at all. The renewal of the application is then a second use of the same token, and the provider refuses it. Expected with 'rotationSafe': the token is burnt instead of being presented again, and the renewal goes on through the hidden iframe, which asks with the SSO session cookie. The user sees nothing, and a fresh refresh token appears in the storage. (Where the browser keeps its cookie out of the iframe the popup comes instead.) Expected with 'original': nothing else is tried, and when the access token is over the popup \"Session has expired\" opens.","descriptionHtml":"The test takes the refresh token the application keeps in the browser and spends it once itself, without touching the application at all. The renewal of the application is then a second use of the same token, and the provider refuses it. Expected with 'rotationSafe': the token is burnt instead of being presented again, and the renewal goes on through the hidden iframe, which asks with the SSO session cookie. The user sees nothing, and a fresh refresh token appears in the storage. (Where the browser keeps its cookie out of the iframe the popup comes instead.) Expected with 'original': nothing else is tried, and when the access token is over the popup \"Session has expired\" opens.\n<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Manual run:</strong> <code>  \uD83D\uDCCB Copy  application.Samples.Feature.signInAgain.TokenRenewalAcrossTabsTest#refreshTokenSpentElsewhere </code> into <a href=\"https://github.com/CX-Box/cxbox-code-samples/actions/workflows/build_bu